"""Static abseil link group for the Debian 13 trixie sysroot (target ai64).

The arm64 static grpc closure in services/com + services/per/impl lists the
abseil 20220623 archive set (bookworm / the from-source orin+jetson closures).
trixie ships abseil 20240722, where grpc/protobuf's references also land in
archives that did not exist before (absl_string_view, absl_log_internal_*,
absl_crc*, absl_kernel_timeout_internal, …). This is the FULL trixie archive
set (ls SYSROOT/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libabsl_*.a), as one more
self-contained static group appended AFTER the common one on
//rules/config:target_ai64 — it resolves what the first group leaves open
without forking the common list. Regenerate when the sysroot's abseil moves.
"""

